WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:01.260
THE GIANTS.

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:02.260
ARE.

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:03.260
HERE!

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:06.640
And Shanks might be too as we got one of the
most BRUTAL.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.960
JAW-DROPPING chapters of the Egghead island
arc.

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:18.090
And WOW, it is INSANE the sheer power on display
by these giants as they wipe ENTIRE SECTIONS

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:21.750
of the marine fleet in a STUNNING SHOW OF
FORCE.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:26.880
And you can say all you want that these are
just fodder marine ships, but I. DO.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:27.880
NOT.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:28.880
CARE!

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:34.490
It is still just so incredible to see such
powerful allies pulling up to help the Straw

00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:35.490
Hats in this scenario.

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:41.629
But while we still don’t see Shanks in this
chapter, I don’t want to entirely rule out

00:00:41.629 --> 00:00:46.480
the possibility of the Red Haired Emperor
being here quite yet.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:52.500
Because there are actually a number of reasons
it makes sense for him to arrive at the future

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:53.500
island.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:59.540
First, we last saw Shanks in chapter 1079
when he completely DEMOLISHED the entire Kid

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:03.160
Pirates in one slash of his sword.

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:08.820
And with that act of violence, we have entered
a new era of Shanks.

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:11.830
No longer is he just sitting around waiting
for things to happen.

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:17.689
Nope, he is ready to claim the One Piece,
so it would make sense that he would be actively

00:01:17.689 --> 00:01:19.909
collecting the poneglyphs.

00:01:19.909 --> 00:01:25.200
And we already saw him take the copies that
Kid had, and we think he got the final one

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:33.490
from Elbaf, so if he is truly on a rampage
towards Laugh Tale then the next easiest step

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:40.250
would be to come to Egghead and steal the
one missing poneglyph copy he is missing from

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:41.790
the Straw Hats.

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:46.649
So yeah, Evil Shanks is still very much on
the table.

00:01:46.649 --> 00:01:52.590
Or, if he’s not here for the Poneglyphs,
there is one other situation that makes just

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:54.180
TOO MUCH SENSE.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:02:00.140
Because remember that even if you have the
poneglyphs you still need someone to actually

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:02.140
read them.

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:10.550
And the one person who can do just that is
Nico Robin, who is on Egghead and conveniently

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:13.600
seems to very much be injured and unable to
protect herself.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:19.220
So just saying, we’ve been waiting for the
Blackbeard pirates to swoop in and kidnap

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:25.550
Robin, but it might be another Emperor doing
just that instead.

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:33.569
And if that wasn’t enough to satisfy your
Shanks fantasy, then also remember that Shanks

00:02:33.569 --> 00:02:38.019
has history with the Celestial Dragons and
the Gorosei.

00:02:38.019 --> 00:02:46.819
In fact, it is likely that he was born a Celestial
dragon AND we’ve even seen him having secret

00:02:46.819 --> 00:02:49.890
conversations with the Five Elders.

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:55.800
So wouldn’t it just make so much sense for
the first time we really get to see a Gorosei’s

00:02:55.800 --> 00:03:00.530
powers that we also learn more about their
connection to Shanks?

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:06.159
Shanks could also clash with the Blackbeard
pirates or the Holy Knights if either of them

00:03:06.159 --> 00:03:11.989
actually show up in the conflict, but either
way, don’t rule out the option of Shanks

00:03:11.989 --> 00:03:18.019
showing up just yet.

00:03:18.019 --> 00:03:28.250
But back to the giants because since WE KNOW
they are here now, it’s time to take a deep

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:33.730
dive into what this means for the current
arc and the future of Elbaf.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:37.890
First let’s break down WHY they are here.

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:46.489
Well, of course remember that in chapter 1066
we learned that Vegapunk studied all of the

00:03:46.489 --> 00:03:51.840
research from Ohara that was rescued and moved
to Elbaf.

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:57.319
Of course, Vegapunk seemed to study with the
survivor of Ohara, who is the giant Jaguar

00:03:57.319 --> 00:04:04.640
D. Saul, so it would make sense that Saul
would want to rescue Vegapunk if he knew his

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.630
friend was in danger.

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:12.260
So we could be seeing Saul very soon if this
is the case.

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:18.340
However, we also see in this chapter that
the two main giants, Dorry and Broggy, proudly

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:21.949
state that they are here for Straw Hat Luffy.

00:04:21.949 --> 00:04:25.169
So maybe it wasn’t Saul who sent the giants
at all.

00:04:25.169 --> 00:04:30.930
If that’s the case then you need to keep
in mind that this guy is a member of the Straw

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:35.520
Hat Grand Fleet, and has a portion of Luffy’s
vivre card.

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:42.020
So it is entirely possible that after Dorry
and Broggy obliterated the Kid pirate’s

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:49.610
ship, they decided to come find Luffy on their
own.

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:54.550
Regardless of the reason though, the fact
is THEY ARE HERE!

00:04:54.550 --> 00:05:00.500
And they’ve already done MASSIVE DAMAGE
by erasing the marine ships surrounding one

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:06.810
part of the island.

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:09.880
Which means, what are they going to do next?

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:15.390
Well, the easy answer is to create an escape
route for the Straw Hats to flee the island.

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:20.770
Remember that in the last chapter, it was
once again explained how the Straw Hats’

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:25.970
original plan to use the VegaForce to get
past the blockade is no longer an option.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:34.090
So the giants showing up creates a much needed
diversion for the crew to eventually escape

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:35.190
on the Sunny.

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:43.130
However, if you think the giants are just
going to walk up and take out Saturn and Kizaru

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:50.000
then you are dead wrong.

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:54.260
Because as impressive as all the damage looks
in this chapter, we have to remember that

00:05:54.260 --> 00:06:00.699
a five year old Big Mom EASILY took out one
of these elder giants who used to be the leaders

00:06:00.699 --> 00:06:02.070
of the Giant Pirates.

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:12.060
So in reality, these guys shouldn't really
be even close to Yonko tier, which would be

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:18.420
the minimum required power level in order
to fight Kizaru or Saturn.

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:22.990
That doesn’t mean that Dorry and Broggy
can’t hold off the World Government fighters

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:32.340
though, just don’t expect this to be a sweeping
victory now that the giants are here.

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:37.580
And while we’re talking about their arrival,
did anyone else see Dorry call Luffy “The

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:38.580
Sun God”???

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:40.100
Like, excuse me!???

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:46.289
That honestly was the most shocking thing
to me about this chapter.

00:06:46.289 --> 00:06:52.740
Because as far as we know, no one has told
the giants that Luffy is Sun God Nika, so

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:58.440
does that mean that the Sun God is already
a part of the giants’ legends?

00:06:58.440 --> 00:07:03.700
If so then that means they could also have
ties to the Buccaneer race which practically

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:10.039
confirms which we’ve long assumed that the
giants were once allies of the Ancient Kingdom

00:07:10.039 --> 00:07:11.310
and Joy Boy!

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:12.510
And wow!

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:20.759
I’m just SO excited that pieces are finally
connecting and if the giants DO KNOW lore

00:07:20.759 --> 00:07:25.789
about Joy Boy, then we could be learning some
of that VERY SOON.

00:07:25.789 --> 00:07:34.639
On top of that, the giants knowing about the
Sun God and possibly Joy Boy just adds another

00:07:34.639 --> 00:07:39.910
One Piece race that is connected to those
figures.

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:45.169
We already know the fishmen made some promise
with Joy Boy and the minks live on Zunesha

00:07:45.169 --> 00:07:48.530
who even said that Joy Boy had returned.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:54.789
And Nika is said to be a hero for oppressed
and enslaved people, so all that put together

00:07:54.789 --> 00:08:00.199
just makes it all the more likely that all
the races of the world will unite with Luffy

00:08:00.199 --> 00:08:03.090
to finally liberate the world.

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:07.889
However, it is also entirely possible that
Shanks told the giants about Luffy's new legendary

00:08:07.889 --> 00:08:14.199
status as well, but I'm not too sure why he
would do that at this point.

00:08:14.199 --> 00:08:23.520
Now to reel things back in, I want to clarify
that at this point I think an escape is more

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:28.560
likely for the Straw Hats than them straight
up defeating Saturn and Kizaru.

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:35.219
But if that is true then they will likely
travel with the giants for at least some time.

00:08:35.219 --> 00:08:42.080
However, as excited as we are for the giants’
arrival it could have SOUL-CRUSHING consequences

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.460
for the future of the story.

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:49.830
Because remember, we have been explicitly
told by Oda that he is trying to condense

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:52.680
the story and get to the end.

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:57.779
And if the giants are showing up here when
no one really expected them, then I could

00:08:57.779 --> 00:09:04.330
easily imagine a scenario where this is the
only true interaction we have with giants

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:05.330
from Elbaf.

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:07.190
Because listen to this.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:12.220
Apart from the thrill of adventure, what did
we expect from Elbaf?

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:13.690
An Usopp moment?

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:16.040
Most likely finding the fourth Road Poneglyph?

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:19.120
A reunion between Robin and Saul?

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:24.779
Well, with the giants arriving here, we could
actually get ALL of those things once the

00:09:24.779 --> 00:09:27.320
crew escapes from Egghead.

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:32.020
Which would mean there is no real need to
go to Elbaf.

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:39.940
And I’m not saying that’s what I want,
but it is a distinct possibility now that

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:44.610
the giants are here on Egghead.

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:51.640
Let’s assume that isn’t the case though,
and once the battle is over then the Straw

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:56.480
Hats would likely sail back to Elbaf with
an escort of giant longships.

00:09:56.480 --> 00:10:02.480
And the question of what happens next would
once again be the most important to discuss.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:07.250
Does Luffy’s alliance with the Giant Pirates
mean he is allied with all the giants?

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.839
Or would the rulers of Elbaf think differently?

00:10:09.839 --> 00:10:15.589
And how does Shanks fit into all this?

00:10:15.589 --> 00:10:22.990
If he isn’t here on Egghead, will the straw
hats still meet him in Elbaf or will he be

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:28.240
off collecting the other one or two poneglyph
copies that he still needs?

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:35.399
I’m not too sure at this point, but there
is one figure connected to the giants that

00:10:35.399 --> 00:10:40.269
we haven’t really discussed yet, and that
is of course Usopp.

00:10:40.269 --> 00:10:52.720
Because it seems like Usopp has been connected
with the giants FOREVER and he has even befriended

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:54.880
many giants throughout the story.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:11:03.149
However, he has literally done NOTHING for
the entire Egghead arc, so if there was an

00:11:03.149 --> 00:11:10.279
Usopp moment that Oda was saving for us, then
the best time for it to come is now that the

00:11:10.279 --> 00:11:11.990
giants have arrived.

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:18.540
And that might mean he has some truly heroic
moment or he gives an inspiring speech, but

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:24.889
either way don’t be surprised if Usopp shows
us something special in the final chapters

00:11:24.889 --> 00:11:26.339
of Egghead.

00:11:26.339 --> 00:11:34.399
As hype as the giants and, potentially Shanks,
arriving is though, there was SO MUCH MORE

00:11:34.399 --> 00:11:36.839
that happened this chapter.

00:11:36.839 --> 00:11:39.170
Because bodies were dropping left and right.

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:42.019
Vegapunk got stabbed by Saturn!

00:11:42.019 --> 00:11:45.030
Franky AND Sanji got blasted by Kizaru!

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:49.060
Then Luffy returned and slammed Kizaru away
from his friends!

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:54.880
Really the battle is heating up, and it seems
like Luffy will end up holding off Kizaru

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:57.900
while the rest of the crew tries to escape.

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:04.830
But that just leaves Saturn, who is still
a MAJOR PROBLEM.

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:11.220
However, we might have actually figured out
how to defeat him because as we all expected,

00:12:11.220 --> 00:12:15.740
the Pacifistas are once again on our side.

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:20.160
And sure we didn’t know how it was going
to happen exactly, but I don't know who is

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:22.190
actually surprised by this twist at this point.

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:29.399
In fact, in this chapter Vegapunk revealed
that he originally programmed Bonney as the

00:12:29.399 --> 00:12:38.649
highest level of command for the Pacifistas
so she can order them to do whatever she wants,

00:12:38.649 --> 00:12:43.010
which completely wipes out Saint Saturn's
commands.

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:48.740
Which obviously the first thing she absolutely
should do is order them to blast Saturn over

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:52.709
and over again until he is dead.

00:12:52.709 --> 00:12:58.149
And if you remember one of the ways we thought
you might be able to kill Saturn is to keep

00:12:58.149 --> 00:13:05.370
hurting him until he runs out of healing,
and an unstoppable wave of lasers beams seems

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:08.080
like the perfect way to do that.

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:14.520
Which could ultimately lead to Saturn’s
death, which would be so, so sweet at this

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:16.360
point.

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:22.070
Or if he isn't dead, then he could also somehow
teleport to protect himself.

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:27.850
I could imagine him doing something similar
to the way he arrived on the island, with

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:29.449
this dark magic circle.

00:13:29.449 --> 00:13:36.500
Although, we don’t know exactly how that
works so who knows if that is even possible.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:42.970
It does leave a few interesting questions
for the future though, such as will Bonney

00:13:42.970 --> 00:13:45.680
be able to control the Pacifistas forever?

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:53.639
If so, that is a major boost to her powers
because these things are so hard to kill.

00:13:53.639 --> 00:13:59.040
And if Vegapunk made Bonney the ultimate authority
for the Pacifista, does that mean he did the

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:01.950
same for the Seraphim?

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:06.970
That one I kinda doubt, since the reason he
gave her command of the Pacifistas was that

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:14.020
he didn’t want Bonney to be hurt by something
that looks like her father, but it’s still

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:15.020
possible.

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:22.120
Though why didn't Vegapunk just reveal this
earlier and save everyone the trouble of fighting

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:24.829
the Pacifistas in the first place???

00:14:24.829 --> 00:14:28.310
I don't know???

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:37.110
But speaking on Bonney’s powers, this chapter
also showed Bonney learning that Luffy is

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:39.269
the real Nika.

00:14:39.269 --> 00:14:45.000
Now remember that just a few chapters ago,
we were shown that Bonney’s powers are fueled

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:48.490
by WHAT SHE BELIEVES is possible.

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:54.100
And when she was about to be killed by Saturn,
she lost faith which basically drained her

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:55.100
powers.

00:14:55.100 --> 00:15:03.199
Now that she’s seen Luffy though, I do wonder
if her powers will be restored or even increased

00:15:03.199 --> 00:15:06.890
because of her renewed faith in Nika.

00:15:06.890 --> 00:15:13.750
And if that’s the case, what kind of amazing
things could she do with her powers?

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:17.730
For example, could she make a future where
her father is still alive?

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:23.230
I’m not sure at this point, but anything
certainly seems possible.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:28.160
As does Bonney’s case to become the next
Straw Hat.

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:34.290
And I know this has been discussed many times
during the Egghead Island arc, but this kind

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:40.649
of moment with Bonney we saw on the epic double
page spread is exactly the type that makes

00:15:40.649 --> 00:15:44.449
me think a person could join the crew.

00:15:44.449 --> 00:15:50.130
It honestly reminds me of Nami’s moment
in Arlong Park and Robin’s in Enies Lobby.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:56.079
To take this even further though, we now have
even more evidence that she fits the normal

00:15:56.079 --> 00:15:58.230
straw hat criteria.

00:15:58.230 --> 00:16:03.029
First, Bonney already has a dark backstory.

00:16:03.029 --> 00:16:09.370
Second, she is clearly being freed by Luffy
and is going through her own character journey

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:11.040
during this arc.

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:16.910
And finally, if she does travel with the Straw
Hats, she has a dream of finding out more

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:19.259
about her father’s Buccaneer culture and
beliefs.

00:16:19.259 --> 00:16:21.400
So bam, there you have it.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:26.199
Literally the perfect Straw Hat candidate,
and since she is still technically a child,

00:16:26.199 --> 00:16:31.069
she could be a cabin girl.

00:16:31.069 --> 00:16:37.569
Or if we want to lean into the religious aspect,
she could be the ship’s priest or something

00:16:37.569 --> 00:16:39.630
along those lines.

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:47.269
Besides that though, there is one thing that
is pretty easy to miss in all the chaos and

00:16:47.269 --> 00:16:48.490
battles happening on the island.

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:55.930
And that’s the fact that we also got the
first hint of movement from the Iron Giant

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:59.720
ever since it first awoke during chapter 1092.

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:07.100
Which it just seems like Oda is really hammering
in the idea that the giant responds to Luffy

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:08.540
using his Gear 5 powers.

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:12.740
I mean, that is also what caused it to wake
up during that prior chapter and now that

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:18.760
Luffy is back to fighting with Gear 5, the
Iron Giant is moving again.

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:28.060
Still so excited to see what is going to happen
next with this piece of ancient technology.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:38.060
Also, can we just appreciate Luffy casually
turning the ground into rubber to catch his

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:39.060
falling friends?

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:45.480
Like, this was a power we thought might be
his true and ONLY awakening power, so to see

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:50.960
it just be one small part of his actual awakening
is pretty awesome if you ask me.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:56.160
And if you are like me and sometimes forget
that Luffy’s Gear 5 powers are more than

00:17:56.160 --> 00:18:08.240
just cartoon wacky abilities, then check out
this video where I fully explain ALL OF Luffy’s

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:20.590
INSANE Awakened abilities [Gear 5 Explained
video].

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:24.480
Shanks for watching, and I’ll see you in
the next one.

